            "review_title": "Review at Limone Italian Foods Cafe & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Teresa P\nWare, United Kingdom7 contributions\n0\nAverage\nNov 2022 • Couples\nMy husband and I visited Limone that was newly opened in Hoddesdon (formerly Zagaras) for our anniversary.\n\nThe pizzas were good. Female staff wore blouses which were tied under their chest to show off midriff which wasn't very professional. The blonde lady behind the bar who I found out to be the bosses daughter was very rude when we arrived. A member of staff was told to \"stick these 2 in the corner \" \nDon't think I will be going there!!\n\nNever experienced anything but smart courtesy staff at Zagaras.\nRead more\nWritten December 15, 2022",
