            "review_text": "Ulsterman1961\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam257 contributions\n1\nNoodle Disapointment - Larger waiting room\nAug 2019 • Friends\nWas recommended this establishment which seemed ok as a local and foreign run Italian, the owner seemed a decent guy, but the staff need attention to detail and listen to what is ordered.\n\nWe ordered A starter of mozzarella and tomato which is quite nice, there after the main event was ravioli type dish with Beef and bacon bits and tomato sauce, sadly I must admit it was undercooked and some pieces of the noodle “ hard” ? , Suce was for my taste salty ( perhaps from the sliced ham and bacon bits??.\n\nTables closely packed in so don’t expect any type of private conversation.\n\nAll in all a disappointment however I’m sure by the looks of it the Pizzas seem presentable...\nRead more\nWritten August 3, 2019",
