            "review_title": "Review at Limone Italian Foods Cafe & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tony\nDa Nang, Vietnam12 contributions\n0\nUndiscovered Gem\nOct 2016 • Friends\nWe have often eaten at Limone since it recently opened and sampled a variety of dishes and drinks. Today we ordered a salad, steak, pizza, tiramisu and Leffe Belgium beer. As usual, the consistency, food, service, calm, fresh air and view were all outstanding! The restaurant is located on the river, on the third floor of the big World Games boat on Tran Hung Dao. Unfortunately, the Limone has yet to rise in Tripadvisor, with only five nice reviews so far, because the mostly Asian clientele don't use or view it. Try Limone, you won't be disappointed.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 2, 2016",
