            "review_text": "Munyoz\nZurich, Switzerland486 contributions\n0\nif you are in Danang - cool option - Very good full 4 marks\nJul 2016 • Couples\nI have been here during a week end, as it was advised by a taxi driver, since is possible to have a view to the Dragon Bridge and see the small show while the dragon spit fire from its mouth. the show is very short, but happy i have seen it. It start at around 9 PM and last about 5 minutes. \n\nThe bar is really nice with a nice view in general. List of drinks is extensive, tasty and within decent price, however higher than in general coffee shop, but please consider the view, so it was fair.\nI would probably go back here, and neither necessary for the show, as i founded as a cool place to chill with friends or special one. \n\nI didn't try their food, but eventually can try next time.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 2, 2016\nLimoneDn\nIt's our pleasure to having nice complement from you, thanks for visiting and hope to seeing you again soon !\nWritten August 14, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
